    {
      "id": 17,
      "type": "Note",
      "title": "H3 requirements and limits",
      "pos": [
        0,
        1000
      ],
      "size": [
        1000,
        220
      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 3,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "Note"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "This is a FULL VIDEO graph, not just text. Default mode requires an edited/reviewed prompt pasted from 05_Vision_Prompt_Draft. Use identical references in identical order and the same length. Choose Generate with Ollama for a one-click prompt-to-video run; preview will NOT pause the render. H3 must be enabled in MODEL_PROFILES and licensed for your intended use. Full BF16 H3 still needs substantial VRAM/RAM. The prompt helper cannot guarantee correct identities or actions. Do not connect H3/Krea model loaders upstream of the prompt builder.\n\nQUALITY BASELINE: 25 steps, full BF16 weights and encoder, original references at max, no Turbo/Lightning or reduced-precision attention. More steps are not a guaranteed likeness upgrade. Use a short representative shot first; peak VRAM is not benchmarked."
      ]
